@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #F6FBF8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
actor 顾客
participant "菜单页" as Menu
participant "订单服务" as OrderSvc
participant "支付平台" as Pay
participant "店员工作台" as StaffApp
participant "通知服务" as Msg
顾客 -> Menu: 扫码进入菜单
Menu -> OrderSvc: 提交购物车与桌位/预约号
OrderSvc -> OrderSvc: 校验菜单可售、过敏提示、重复提交
alt 校验通过
  OrderSvc -> Pay: 创建支付单(amount, traceId)
  Pay --> OrderSvc: 支付成功回调(tradeNo)
  OrderSvc -> OrderSvc: 幂等确认订单状态
  OrderSvc -> StaffApp: 推送待制作订单
  StaffApp --> OrderSvc: 接单/制作/完成
  OrderSvc -> Msg: 发送取餐或服务提醒
  Msg --> 顾客: 到店服务/取餐通知
else 售罄或支付失败
  OrderSvc --> Menu: 返回失败原因与可替代菜品
end
@enduml
